; XAU300_ORB_Research preset: EXECUTION DIAGNOSTIC 2% risk (spread gate off)
; Derived from XAU300_ORB_Research_balanced2.set: the ONLY change is InpMaxSpreadPrice=0.60 -> 0 (no spread filter).
; Real bid/ask spread is still paid on every fill; this only stops skipping wide-spread breaks.
; Adaptive/exploratory after seeing the 0.60 gate skip most breaks in MT5 (2026-11-08). Not out-of-sample, no claim of superiority.
; Daily hard stop 3% and DD stop 20% unchanged. With 5% risk a losing trade usually hits the 3% daily stop first.
